{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Train</strong> is a single-player survival game where you travel through an infected world on a fuel-hungry train. Loot abandoned houses, fight off zombies, and trade your findings for weapons and coal to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/cc42efc4a4cfc7c173b1e759f8804018.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/ad79c600bf1abf9ef06032951f61ebbd.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/ad79c600bf1abf9ef06032951f61ebbd.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/ad79c600bf1abf9ef06032951f61ebbd.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your train through a post-apocalyptic world overrun by infection. Keep it fueled and moving as you make your way toward the last known safe zone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/0d5329403b7d6494a90284ad997d13f8.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/0d5329403b7d6494a90284ad997d13f8.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/0d5329403b7d6494a90284ad997d13f8.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/4677ee3de0ed139814b9325567b7fdcd.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/4677ee3de0ed139814b9325567b7fdcd.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/4677ee3de0ed139814b9325567b7fdcd.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop at abandoned houses and explore every corner. Gather fuel, items, and valuable resources to stay alive and keep your journey going.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e7bfd55dfae0b3228e10b8731af4fb67.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e7bfd55dfae0b3228e10b8731af4fb67.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e7bfd55dfae0b3228e10b8731af4fb67.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e031c215b9627cff13cac6615d01c412.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e031c215b9627cff13cac6615d01c412.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/e031c215b9627cff13cac6615d01c412.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade the items you collect for money. Buy more fuel, better weapons, and supplies to improve your chances of reaching the safe zone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/5df962085feab0e37eca655b6fa7ab3b.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/5df962085feab0e37eca655b6fa7ab3b.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/5df962085feab0e37eca655b6fa7ab3b.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/47bd057fc7c09ab57407b64eba5686b6.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/47bd057fc7c09ab57407b64eba5686b6.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/47bd057fc7c09ab57407b64eba5686b6.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase and equip a variety of weapons. From pistols to shotguns, pick the right gear to defend yourself against the infected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/3c312488c7c9d67955734798561115b2.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/3c312488c7c9d67955734798561115b2.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/3c312488c7c9d67955734798561115b2.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/45841b9c43240071847940aca6e0d8c4.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/45841b9c43240071847940aca6e0d8c4.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/45841b9c43240071847940aca6e0d8c4.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless zombie attacks that test your reflexes and strategy. Every enemy you defeat brings you one step closer to survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/73d82fed482b4abf6ee7098b7add1047.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/73d82fed482b4abf6ee7098b7add1047.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/73d82fed482b4abf6ee7098b7add1047.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/1a31c5bc2d4fb7f9d1859d3e2871b256.poster.avif?t=1755256635\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/1a31c5bc2d4fb7f9d1859d3e2871b256.webm?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/extras/1a31c5bc2d4fb7f9d1859d3e2871b256.mp4?t=1755256635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond the tracks lies a scorched desert \u2014 abandoned houses, sand-covered wreckage, and a deadly silence. Scavenge for supplies, gather anything useful, and find fuel before making it back to your train. But the sun burns and danger lurks with every step. Shade is shelter. Time is your enemy. Stay too long, you won't return....</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847230?t=1755256635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847230?t=1755256635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/1d384e4b22dd1fe3988ce541b2bf9e55d89910c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755256635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847230/1d384e4b22dd1fe3988ce541b2bf9e55d89910c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755256635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Train</strong> is a single-player survival game where you travel through an infected world on a fuel-hungry train. Loot abandoned houses, fight off zombies, and trade your findings for weapons and coal to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_pa